{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>PhotoSpaceSlim: Photo Cleaner 是一款協助整理相片儲存空間的工具，適合相片數量多、經常收到儲存空間不足提示，又擔心誤刪重要相片的使用者。它提供免費無限掃描與本機分析，現時以原價 US $0.99 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>；刪除操作需一次性解鎖，價格以 App Store 顯示為準。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-198.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>本機分析相片佔用</h2>\n<p>PhotoSpaceSlim 會掃描相片圖庫，分析儲存空間並按類型顯示用量，讓使用者先了解空間去向。每個清理建議都可逐項預覽，由使用者自行選擇要移除的項目，不會自動刪除。所有分析在本機完成，相片不會上傳，亦毋須帳戶、沒有廣告及第三方追蹤；刪除功能需一次性解鎖，沒有訂閱或自動續費。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-216-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-217-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-218-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-219-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-220-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：PhotoSpaceSlim: Photo Cleaner</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/photospaceslim-photo-cleaner/id6820449289?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T01:13:19.225068+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":364,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T00:55:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T16:58:38.829862+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T01:06:33.223921+00:00","content_hash":"fb9d1ab023ecc538f2e5b9bc13cacbe7bc46ae878041016e85fb8c521ee133ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}